WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.470
Hey Conan here again, and
we're trying to raise money

00:00:02.470 --> 00:00:05.940
for a good cause on the holidays,

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:09.860
Great way to help children
during the holiday season.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.180
Donate, there should be information

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:12.480
at the bottom of the screen.

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:14.469
If there isn't, I'll fire
the person responsible,

00:00:14.469 --> 00:00:15.860
on Christmas Eve.

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:17.150
That's the kind of guy I am.

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:19.500
All right, I got some
great people handling

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:20.510
this today with me,

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:21.930
Mr. Jimmy Vivino,

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:24.560
we got James, The Worm, Wormworth,

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:26.490
what an awful nickname, on drums.

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:29.170
And then Mike Merritt on the bass guitar.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:31.320
Then helping us out, Skills is gonna play

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:33.050
that jingly jangly thing.

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:36.900
Went to, yes, nine years
of music college for that.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:39.910
Anyway, there are only
two great Christmas songs

00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:41.230
in the world, we all know that.

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:43.070
One, of course Handel's Messiah,

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:45.430
the other by The Kinks.

00:00:45.430 --> 00:00:46.690
Let's try that second one.

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:47.920
Doctor, take us away.

